# Capacitor-generated native projects: generated on the CI runner via `npx cap add`, BY
# DESIGN (decision 2026-08-24) — the workflow patches versioning, the bundle id, and the
# network-security config after generation, and package-lock.json pins the npm inputs, so
# the build is reproducible without vendoring two native project trees here.
/android/
/ios/

# Deps and staged web bundle (copied from apps/app/dist before `cap sync`).
/node_modules/
/dist/
/www/

# Mobile build outputs
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa

.DS_Store
